+  #
+  # OPERATOR PREREQUISITE — set GitHub repo secrets BEFORE triggering this job:
+  #   - OPENAI_API_KEY              (used by openai_agents_sdk + judge + judge_calibrate tests)
+  #   - ANTHROPIC_API_KEY           (used by claude_agent_sdk test)
